<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR DROPS TO 10.69PCT FROM 11.89PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR DROPS TO 10.69PCT FROM 11.89PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month dropped to 10.69 percent from 11.89</p>
<p>percent and the bid rate (Athibid) fell to 10.18 percent from</p>
<p>11.40 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
<p> DATE     1-MTH   2-MTH   3-MTH   6-MTH   9-MTH   12-MTH</p>
