<p> Mar  17  11.46   11.39   11.31   11.12   11.01   10.91</p>
<p> Mar  07  11.49   11.42   11.32   11.12   11.02   10.96</p>
<p> Mar  06  11.49   11.42   11.32   11.12   11.02   10.96</p>
<p>Note: ATHIBOR is Greece's official reference rate. It comprises</p>
<p>18 leading state and private banks committed to quoting their</p>
<p>rates by 0900 GMT every day.</p>
